Certainly! To create a custom dashboard in Kibana 8.2 that displays real-time data such as agent status, log messages, and performance metrics, you can extend the structure of the dashboard object to include more panels and customize their layout. Below is an example of how you can achieve this using a hypothetical `Kibana` class and its `create_dashboard` method.

