By incorporating robust error handling, conditional execution, and notification mechanisms, you can effectively manage failures during the execution of runbook steps in your CI/CD pipeline. This ensures that issues are identified and addressed promptly, maintaining the integrity and reliability of your maintenance processes. If you have any further questions or need additional assistance, feel free to ask!

