### Integrating with CI/CD Pipeline

You can integrate this script into your CI/CD pipeline to automatically check logs and send alerts. Here is an example of how you might do this in a Jenkinsfile:

```groovy
pipeline {
    agent any

    stages {
        stage('Checkout') {
            steps {
                git 'https://github.com/your-repo.git'
            }
        }

        stage('Build') {
            steps {
                sh 'pip install -r requirements.txt'
                sh 'python setup.py build'
            }
        }

        stage('Test') {
